@base = http://localhost:3000
@cronSecret = 填入 .env 的 CRON_SECRET

### A股统计
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stats

### 股票清单（搜索/筛选/分页）
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stocks?keyword=茅台&market=sh&page=1&pageSize=20

### 单股日线
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stocks/600519/daily?limit=120

### 单股筹码分布
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stocks/600519/chips

### 单股关联快讯
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stocks/600519/news?limit=30

### 快讯列表（只看已关联）
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/news?page=1&pageSize=30&onlyMatched=1

### 放量信号
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/signals?type=bottom_volume&limit=100

### 手动同步-全量
POST {{base}}/api/ashare/sync?type=all
Authorization: Bearer {{cronSecret}}

### 手动同步-指定股票回补
POST {{base}}/api/ashare/sync?type=daily&codes=600519,000001
Authorization: Bearer {{cronSecret}}

### 登录（账号密码）
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "admin123"}
